{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ועל</b> — And they take a pledge from the poor; they pervert justice. And this they do publicly in the place where they assemble to the altar of Baal. And likewise, \"and wine of those fined they drink\" — they fine one who has no fine upon him, and they drink [it]."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:47.187556813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}